GAPS IDENTIFIED IN testing1 (test2 must close these)
==================================================

1. POLICY PROFILE STRICTNESS [TA-07, newly fixed]
   - Conservative (safe>=75), Balanced (safe>=65), Aggressive (safe>=55) now enforce
     DIFFERENT raw score cutoffs after the multiplier was removed.
   - testing1 had a test asserting they were ~equal (~65). That test was DELETED.
   - testing2 MUST verify all three profiles produce DISTINCT score thresholds.

2. SCORE DETERMINISM ACROSS PROFILES
   - Same graph input should produce same raw score under different profile weight adjustments only if weights differ.

3. DB PRIVACY AUDIT
   - SQLite stores walletAddress, score, recommendation, protocols, donId.
   - No test checks that modelWeights, thresholds are NOT stored.

4. API RESPONSE SHAPE
   - featuresSummary is exposed in /api/score (allowed). No test checks exact allowed vs. disallowed fields.

5. GATE WITH NULL ATTESTATION
   - executeScoreGatedAction with attestation: null should throw GATE_ERROR.

6. NL -> PROFILE -> SCORER INTEGRATION
   - "conservative" keyword in NL prompt routes policyProfileId correctly into scorer.

7. GRAPH SCHEMA NORMALIZATION EDGE CASES
   - null account response, zero positions, partial position data.

8. ZERO-DEBT WALLET SCORING
   - Large collateral + zero debt: should score >= 90.

9. ZERO-POSITION VERIFIED WALLET
   - dataComplete: true, empty positions: should score deterministically.

10. AGENT LOOP FAIL-CLOSED ON GRAPH OUTAGE
    - Mock fetch throws network error -> agent loop propagates GRAPH_DATA_UNAVAILABLE.

11. ATTESTATION STATUS FIELD ACCURACY
    - LOCAL_PROTOTYPE_MODE -> status != VERIFIED_ENCLAVE_EXECUTION.
    - Forged 0xattest_ -> status = INVALID_ATTESTATION.

12. RATE LIMITER BODY SHAPE
    - 429 response body has { error: RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED, message: string }.

13. GATE BOUNDARY VALUES
    - score == threshold -> passed = true.
    - score == threshold - 1 -> passed = false.

14. CRE WORKFLOW YAML ACCURACY
    - workflow.yaml contains workflowId "006da2b7" prefix and handlerInTee: true.

15. FEATURESSUMMARY EXPOSURE BOUNDARY (HTTP)
    - /api/score response does NOT include modelWeights, thresholds, policyProfiles, ltvScore.

